        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: 3:10 to Yuma (2007 film), Serenity, Tucker & Dale vs. Evil, DodgeBall: A True Underdog Story, A Knight's Tale\n- People: James Mangold, Cathy Konrad, Russell Crowe, Christian Bale, Peter Fonda, Gretchen Mol, Ben Foster, Dallas Roberts, Alan Tudyk, Vinessa Shaw, Logan Lerman, Alan Wray Tudyk\n- Television series: Firefly, Dollhouse\n- Roles: Hoban \"Wash\" Washburne, Alpha, Tucker McGee, Steve the Pirate, Wat\n\nFacts:\n- Alan Wray Tudyk was born on March 16, 1971, and he is an American actor and voice actor.\n- Alan Tudyk is known for playing Hoban \"Wash\" Washburne in the television series Firefly and the film Serenity.\n- Alan Tudyk is known for playing Alpha in the television series Dollhouse.\n- Alan Tudyk is known for playing Tucker McGee in the film Tucker & Dale vs. Evil, Steve the Pirate in the film DodgeBall: A True Underdog Story, and Wat in the film A Knight's Tale.\n- 3:10 to Yuma is a 2007 American Western film directed by James Mangold and produced by Cathy Konrad.\n- 3:10 to Yuma stars Russell Crowe and Christian Bale in the lead roles.\n- 3:10 to Yuma features supporting performances by Peter Fonda, Gretchen Mol, Ben Foster, Dallas Roberts, Alan Tudyk, Vinessa Shaw, and Logan Lerman.",
